        "title": "06 - Phototypesetting: The Transitional Era (1950s–1980s)",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GENERATION 1 (1950s): Mechanical/Optical\n  Physical film negatives of characters + light flash + photographic paper\n  Rotating disk or filmstrip of character images\n  Speed: slight improvement over hot metal\n  Examples: Photon (USA), Intertype Fotosetter"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHOTOTYPESETTING.md#005",
      "path": [
